  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/610492/description_19c704fd-83da-48c6-93bc-c39ae13831db.png\" alt=\"crispytwig x Starfish\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maQ6tE6Nsd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1378839788659933345?style=flat-square&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Discord&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/989479?style=flat-square&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=CurseForge&color=f16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbuilding-but-better\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/building-but-better?style=flat-square&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=Modrinth&color=00af5c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MC-1.20.1-6b6b88?style=flat-square&logo=minecraft&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Versions\"></a></p>\n<h3>⚠️ 注意：</h3>\n<p>目前该模组正在为 1.21.1 版本进行全面重写——我正在从头开始重新制作所有的方块、功能、代码和艺术资源。在此期间，请对我保持耐心 :-)</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>📋 简介</h3>\n<p><strong>Building But Better（建造更佳）</strong> 是一款受 Conquest、Cocricot 和 Miniaturia 等其他模组启发的模组，旨在通过扩展 Minecraft 的形状并增加通过方块交互实现的自定义功能，成为原版建筑玩家的必备工具。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obfbftBwscY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube 预告片</a></p>",
